1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,745
W: Television sales have increased dramatically recently.

2
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:08,280
M: All the credit for that goes to our newest TV, the HD5000.

3
00:00:09,285 --> 00:00:14,540
TV sales reached their lowest point during the month it came out, but they've been going up ever since.

4
00:00:15,340 --> 00:00:16,340
W: I had no idea.

5
00:00:17,020 --> 00:00:19,140
Are we running any special ads?

6
00:00:19,820 --> 00:00:20,490
M: Not really.

7
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:26,220
We're advertising on TV, radio, and the Internet, but we aren't spending more money than usual.

8
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:31,260
Mostly, people are purchasing the HD5000 because it's so well made.

9
00:00:31,580 --> 00:00:32,700
W: That's excellent news.

10
00:00:33,380 --> 00:00:35,320
Could you copy that sales report for me?

11
00:00:36,235 --> 00:00:40,340
M: No problem, but I'll need to run upstairs because our copier is out of toner.
